{
    "m_SGVersion": 0,
    "m_Type": "UnityEditor.ShaderGraph.StickyNoteData",
    "m_ObjectId": "7c818d69edd941b391a55a01b97c857d",
    "m_Title": "Int Foam Mask",
    "m_Content": "Screen Position supplies the UVs for sampling the depth buffer.\n\nDepth Fade returns a value that changes when geometry is close behind the water.\n\nadding 0.1 makes the foam actually visable\n\nsmoothstep cuts off stuff below water at a stepped rate",
